{"title": "Non-Invasive Procedure", "pageid": 34339, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Non-Invasive_Procedure", "categories": ["Achievements"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Non-Invasive Procedure</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\">achievement</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. It requires the player to kill <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malus Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a> before he \"performs surgery\" on a player character. This refers to the four special actions he can perform after using his <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Request_Surgical_Instrument\" title=\"Request Surgical Instrument\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Request Surgical Instrument\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Request_Surgical_Instrument\" title=\"Request Surgical Instrument\">Request Surgical Instrument</a> special action. See <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm/Combat\" title=\"Malus Thorm/Combat\">Fighting Malus Thorm</a> for details.\n</p><p>Malus is encountered in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>, within the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a>. He and four \"sisters\" are performing surgery on a helpless victim in an operating theatre.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Strategy\">Strategy</span></h2>\n<p>To get the achievement, combat must be initiated. Convincing Malus to allow the sisters to perform surgery on him, thereby killing him without combat, does not work.\n</p><p>In combat, the sisters can stun and hold party members, allowing Malus to perform surgery. Therefore, it is best to eliminate them first. This can be done even before entering combat, by convincing Malus that the sisters need to improve their surgical skills by practicing on each other.\n</p><p>During combat, Malus attempts to resurrect the sisters by touching them, so holding or immobilizing him is helpful.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714231516\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 481/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3542/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 730/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 548801/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   11.835      1 -total\n 85.18%   10.081      2 Template:Icon_link\n 81.94%    9.697      2 Template:Icon_text\n 81.87%    9.689      1 Template:CharLink\n 70.59%    8.354      4 Template:Trim\n 56.60%    6.699      2 Template:Ifempty\n 17.85%    2.113      1 Template:SAI\n  9.39%    1.111      2 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34339-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714231516 and revision id 364676. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}